        "section": "rule",
        "sentence_id": "p7_r1"
      },
      "text": "In order to hide services, the Driver will access the memory of the services.exe process, locate the linked list of services and remove the service entry that the Driver wishes to hide. This is a surprisingly invasive method to obfuscate a process.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.98,
