        "section": "rule",
        "sentence_id": "p15_r1"
      },
      "text": "Support Software In addition to the main Hikit malware, there are at least two examples of support programs that belong to the Hikit family. Samples b04de6c417b6f8836e3f2d8822be2e68f4f9722b and 7c4da9deff3e5c7611b9e1bd67d0e74aa7d2d0f6 are examples of Gen 1.0 and Gen 1.2 operator consoles. The console is a text based application that takes a Gen 1.0 or Gen 1.2 infection’s IP address and proceeds to connect and authenticate with the infected server. Once connected, the operator has the basic Hikit functionalities available to them via commands such as file and shell .",
      "language": "en",
